01:11:55.687 --> 01:11:57.731
What the fuck? [groans]

1011
01:11:59.149 --> 01:12:02.402
Let me the fuck out of here.
Goddamn it.

1012
01:12:05.614 --> 01:12:07.657
Oh. Thank you.

1013
01:12:13.163 --> 01:12:14.331
[whispering] What the fuck?

1014
01:12:22.506 --> 01:12:25.300
Jesus Christ. What the fuck?
Hey. yo. you good?

1015
01:12:25.383 --> 01:12:26.468
- [Paul snarling]
- Jesus Christ. bro!

1016
01:12:26.551 --> 01:12:28.303
- Hey! Get off me. bro!
- [Paul growls]

1017
01:12:28.386 --> 01:12:31.389
Get the fuck off me!
Get the fuck off me!

1018
01:12:31.473 --> 01:12:32.724
Hey! Fuck!

1019
01:12:32.807 --> 01:12:35.519
Help me! Help me!
Someone. please help me!

1020
01:12:40.690 --> 01:12:42.901
[Justine] <i>I'm telling you.
Marcus. I've seen it myself.</i>

1021
01:12:42.984 --> 01:12:45.654
<i>There's something
very. very wrong</i>

1022
01:12:45.737 --> 01:12:47.030
<i>going on inside of that house.</i>

1023
01:12:47.113 --> 01:12:48.114
<i>If you don't believe me.</i>

1024
01:12:48.198 --> 01:12:49.366
- <i>go there yourself.</i>
- Justine. stop.

1025
01:12:49.449 --> 01:12:50.825
Here's the bottom line.

1026
01:12:50.909 --> 01:12:52.327
Alex has been
traumatized enough

1027
01:12:52.410 --> 01:12:54.496
by the events
of the last two months.

1028
01:12:54.579 --> 01:12:56.665
- as I'm sure you have.
- <i>Marcus...</i>

1029
01:12:56.748 --> 01:12:58.959
Which is why I'm gonna do
you the courtesy

1030
01:12:59.042 --> 01:13:01.002
of forgetting that this
phone call ever took place.

1031
01:13:01.086 --> 01:13:04.464
<i>If a child's welfare
is questioned. by law...</i>

1032
01:13:04.548 --> 01:13:05.632
- Justine.
- <i>...you have to refer it</i>

1033
01:13:05.715 --> 01:13:07.217
<i>to CPS.</i>

1034
01:13:07.300 --> 01:13:08.301
<i>By law.</i>

1035
01:13:08.385 --> 01:13:09.803
Are you really gonna
take it there?

1036
01:13:10.804 --> 01:13:12.389
Is this the corner
you're gonna put me in?

1037
01:13:12.472 --> 01:13:14.808
<i>Just go make the house call.
Marcus. Just do that.</i>

1038
01:13:14.891 --> 01:13:18.645
I'm not authorized
to just make house calls.

1039
01:13:18.728 --> 01:13:20.772
<i>Well. you're a mandatory
reporter. You have to.</i>

1040
01:13:21.481 --> 01:13:22.649
Okay. here's what I'll do.

1041
01:13:22.732 --> 01:13:25.694
I'll invite his parents to
come in. have a talk with me.

1042
01:13:25.777 --> 01:13:28.238
We'll have a face-to-face
at the school.

1043
01:13:28.321 --> 01:13:29.948
Is that acceptable to you?

1044
01:13:30.031 --> 01:13:32.534
<i>Yes. thank you. I would
really appreciate that.</i>

1045
01:13:32.617 --> 01:13:35.078
Okay. then. You're welcome.
Goodbye.

1046
01:13:37.539 --> 01:13:39.332
- [knocking at door]
- Yeah.

1047
01:13:42.168 --> 01:13:43.712
Your two o'clock is here.

1048
01:13:43.795 --> 01:13:44.921
That's fine.

1049
01:13:48.550 --> 01:13:51.344
Well. send them in. please.
Marge.

1050
01:13:53.972 --> 01:13:55.140
This way. ma'am.

1051
01:14:08.737 --> 01:14:11.281
Principal Miller. I'm Gladys.

1052
01:14:12.365 --> 01:14:14.492
Yes. H-Hi. Hi.

1053
01:14:15.035 --> 01:14:16.036
Come on in.

1054
01:14:16.786 --> 01:14:19.331
- Have a seat. please.
- Oh. thank you.

1055
01:14:25.170 --> 01:14:26.171
Thank you. Marge.

1056
01:14:30.467 --> 01:14:32.802
Thank you for coming in. I...

1057
01:14:33.428 --> 01:14:36.139
I know you guys have had
a lot of attention lately.

1058
01:14:36.222 --> 01:14:38.767
Not all of it
could possibly be wanted.

1059
01:14:38.850 --> 01:14:41.144
I'm happy to come by.
It's fine.

1060
01:14:41.227 --> 01:14:42.937
Okay. Forgive me...

1061
01:14:43.021 --> 01:14:44.856
We have not met.
Is that right?

1062
01:14:45.565 --> 01:14:46.941
No. I don't think so.

1063
01:14:47.025 --> 01:14:48.568
- Okay... Phew.
- [Gladys laughs]

1064
01:14:48.652 --> 01:14:52.238
Because I was relatively
certain I'd remember.

1065
01:14:52.906 --> 01:14:55.283
I know I've met
Alex's father before.

1066
01:14:55.367 --> 01:14:56.910
I'm Alex's aunt.

1067
01:14:56.993 --> 01:14:58.495
and his mom's my baby sister.

1068
01:14:58.578 --> 01:15:01.831
Okay. So you're not
his legal guardian.

1069
01:15:01.915 --> 01:15:04.501
Well. no. That would be
his parents. of course.

1070
01:15:04.584 --> 01:15:06.836
Okay. Well. uh...

1071
01:15:06.920 --> 01:15:07.921
Forgive me. Gladys.

1072
01:15:08.004 --> 01:15:11.883
but unfortunately. I need
to speak with his parents.

1073
01:15:11.966 --> 01:15:13.343
[sighs]

1074
01:15:13.843 --> 01:15:15.845
Well. I hate to say it.

1075
01:15:15.929 --> 01:15:18.807
but his parents have been
feeling unwell as of late.

1076
01:15:18.890 --> 01:15:21.685
and I'm staying with them
to help take care of Alex.

1077
01:15:21.768 --> 01:15:23.561
Oh. S-Sounds serious.

1078
01:15:24.229 --> 01:15:26.398
Oh. no. No. it's not serious.
Nothing terminal.

1079
01:15:26.481 --> 01:15:28.024
It's just a touch
of consumption.

1080
01:15:28.108 --> 01:15:29.651
"A touch of consumption"?

1081
01:15:30.318 --> 01:15:31.152
Yeah.

1082
01:15:31.986 --> 01:15:33.321
You know what?

1083
01:15:33.405 --> 01:15:34.489
I'm embarrassed to say

1084
01:15:34.572 --> 01:15:36.908
I guess I don't really know
what that means.

1085
01:15:37.409 --> 01:15:38.410
I thought it was something

1086
01:15:38.493 --> 01:15:40.245
settlers got
on the Oregon Trail.

1087
01:15:40.328 --> 01:15:41.913
[both laughing]

1088
01:15:42.664 --> 01:15:44.749
- What is it? Tuberculosis?
- You know what?

1089
01:15:44.833 --> 01:15:49.295
They are doing just fine.
but they need to stay home.

1090
01:15:50.922 --> 01:15:53.675
I had hoped to speak to them
in person because...

1091
01:15:53.758 --> 01:15:56.136
[inhales]...this is awkward.

1092
01:15:56.678 --> 01:15:59.931
but a concerned individual has
lodged a welfare complaint.

1093
01:16:00.014 --> 01:16:01.933
And unfortunately.
I need to make contact

1094
01:16:02.016 --> 01:16:04.227
with the child's
legal guardian.

1095
01:16:04.310 --> 01:16:06.604
It's something
that's not really negotiable.

1096
01:16:06.688 --> 01:16:09.441
I need to speak
with their parents in person.

1097
01:16:09.524 --> 01:16:10.942
Oh. dear.

1098
01:16:11.025 --> 01:16:13.778
I could come over to the house
if that would make it easier.

1099
01:16:14.571 --> 01:16:17.240
I'm just trying to avoid
involving CPS.

1100
01:16:17.323 --> 01:16:18.867
- But frankly...
- CPS?

1101
01:16:18.950 --> 01:16:21.077
...I'm not convinced
that anything is wrong.

1102
01:16:21.161 --> 01:16:22.746
Who made the complaint?

1103
01:16:23.496 --> 01:16:25.540
I'm not at liberty to say.

1104
01:16:28.126 --> 01:16:30.044
Well. this is very upsetting.

1105
01:16:30.128 --> 01:16:33.465
[TV] <i>It is now that
all free will has been lost.</i>

1106
01:16:34.841 --> 01:16:36.718
<i>The ant moves
under the direction</i>

1107
01:16:36.801 --> 01:16:39.095
<i>of a mind separate
from its own.</i>

1108
01:16:41.264 --> 01:16:42.849
<i>Here. the ant initiates
its death grip.</i>

1109
01:16:42.932 --> 01:16:44.684
Yum. yum. yum.

1110
01:16:44.768 --> 01:16:45.810
There we go.

1111
01:16:48.438 --> 01:16:52.734
<i>As the parasitic Cordyceps
continue to feed of fits body.</i>

1112
01:16:52.817 --> 01:16:54.277
That's disgusting.

1113
01:16:57.864 --> 01:16:59.866
<i>Fungal fruiting occurs next.</i>

1114
01:17:01.659 --> 01:17:03.203
- <i>Large blooms...</i>
- [doorbell rings]

1115
01:17:03.286 --> 01:17:04.370
<i>...that serve
to spread more spores...</i>

1116
01:17:04.454 --> 01:17:05.455
Who could that be?

1117
01:17:08.082 --> 01:17:11.127
<i>...that will find more ants.</i>

1118
01:17:11.753 --> 01:17:12.754
[man] Ew.

1119
01:17:16.216 --> 01:17:18.384
[panting]

1120
01:17:18.468 --> 01:17:20.303
- Thank God you're home.
- [man] Who is it?

1121
01:17:21.137 --> 01:17:22.847
I'm so sorry to disturb you
on a Saturday.

1122
01:17:22.931 --> 01:17:24.849
Oh. will you please.
please forgive me?

1123
01:17:24.933 --> 01:17:26.226
We're just sitting down.

1124
01:17:26.309 --> 01:17:28.895
The bus didn't pick me up
where it was scheduled to.

1125
01:17:28.978 --> 01:17:30.897
And I had realized
far too late...

1126
01:17:30.980 --> 01:17:32.315
[inhales]

1127
01:17:32.398 --> 01:17:34.400
...that I was standing
on the wrong corner.

1128
01:17:34.484 --> 01:17:35.902
And by the time
I put that together.

1129
01:17:35.985 --> 01:17:38.571
oh. I'd missed it entirely.

1130
01:17:38.655 --> 01:17:42.450
So I had to walk all the way
across town to get here.

1131
01:17:42.534 --> 01:17:43.993
Well. I'm so sorry
to hear that...

1132
01:17:44.077 --> 01:17:46.079
I am sorry to tell you this.
sweetie.

1133
01:17:46.162 --> 01:17:48.665
but I am on the verge
of collapse.

1134
01:17:48.748 --> 01:17:49.582
Oh.

1135
01:17:51.751 --> 01:17:53.586
Could I please
have some water?

1136
01:17:54.921 --> 01:17:55.922
I'm afraid that's re...

1137
01:17:56.005 --> 01:17:58.216
Of course
you can have some water.

1138
01:17:58.299 --> 01:17:59.509
Oh. thank you so much.

1139
01:17:59.592 --> 01:18:00.969
I'm afraid
it's really not a...

1140
01:18:01.052 --> 01:18:02.846
My name's Gladys.
it's so nice to meet you.

1141
01:18:02.929 --> 01:18:03.930
Hi.

1142
01:18:04.639 --> 01:18:08.226
Oh! I absolutely love
this house.

1143
01:18:08.309 --> 01:18:11.145
Look. a giraffe
and a green Chinese la...

1144
01:18:11.229 --> 01:18:13.273
That's original in there.
I bet it is.

1145
01:18:13.356 --> 01:18:15.567
[clapping]
Oh. I just love this kitchen.

1146
01:18:15.650 --> 01:18:19.153
Clean. white cabinets.
How I'm envious of that.

1147
01:18:19.237 --> 01:18:20.280
[laughs]

1148
01:18:20.989 --> 01:18:23.283
Now. listen.
I know that it's inconvenient.

1149
01:18:23.366 --> 01:18:25.076
but I really needed
to speak to you

1150
01:18:25.159 --> 01:18:27.078
about our conversation
yesterday.

1151
01:18:27.161 --> 01:18:28.746
[coughs] Oh.

1152
01:18:28.830 --> 01:18:29.706
[coughs]

1153
01:18:29.789 --> 01:18:31.291
Marcus. get her a glass.

1154
01:18:31.374 --> 01:18:33.042
A bowl. please.

1155
01:18:35.128 --> 01:18:36.129
A bowl?

1156
01:18:36.212 --> 01:18:38.715
Yes. a bowl.
It's a peculiarity of mine.

1157
01:18:38.798 --> 01:18:40.884
I don't even try
to rationalize it anymore.

1158
01:18:43.887 --> 01:18:46.764
A bowl of water. Okay.

1159
01:18:46.848 --> 01:18:47.932
Thank you.

1160
01:18:48.016 --> 01:18:50.476
I-I wanted you to know that
I talked to Alex's father.

1161
01:18:50.560 --> 01:18:52.395
who's very ill. as I said.

1162
01:18:52.478 --> 01:18:54.647
But the good news is.
he's more than happy

1163
01:18:54.731 --> 01:18:57.150
to come in Monday.
sit down with you

1164
01:18:57.233 --> 01:18:58.526
and clear everything up.

1165
01:18:59.569 --> 01:19:02.488
I appreciate that.
but it really is unnecessary.

1166
01:19:02.572 --> 01:19:04.908
So there's no need to contact
the authorities. right?

1167
01:19:04.991 --> 01:19:05.825
That's. uh...

1168
01:19:06.534 --> 01:19:07.827
Sure. I guess not.

1169
01:19:07.911 --> 01:19:10.163
I mean. you haven't
contacted them yet. right?

1170
01:19:10.246 --> 01:19:13.082
Gladys. I'm really gonna
have to insist that you. uh...

1171
01:19:15.418 --> 01:19:17.128
Is... Is that my ribbon?

1172
01:19:19.714 --> 01:19:21.925
You haven't
contacted them. right?

1173
01:19:22.967 --> 01:19:24.802
No. I haven't. What is this?

1174
01:19:27.388 --> 01:19:28.389
[man] Oh. my God!

1175
01:19:28.473 --> 01:19:30.892
Whoops! Look what I did.
Oh. my goodness.

1176
01:19:30.975 --> 01:19:32.518
Why did you do that?

1177
01:19:32.602 --> 01:19:34.729
Well. it was an accident.
of course.

1178
01:19:34.812 --> 01:19:36.940
Wow. That's really bleeding.

1179
01:19:37.023 --> 01:19:38.107
Terry. go get the alcohol

1180
01:19:38.191 --> 01:19:39.651
- and the first aid kit.
- Okay.

1181
01:19:39.734 --> 01:19:42.070
Oh. no. no. no.
That's nonsense.

1182
01:19:42.153 --> 01:19:44.656
Could you get me
a rag. sweetie?

1183
01:19:44.739 --> 01:19:46.199
[stammering]

1184
01:19:52.038 --> 01:19:53.206
[shrieks]

1185
01:19:53.790 --> 01:19:54.874
I think she cut my hair!

1186
01:19:54.958 --> 01:19:56.084
I'm calling 911.

1187
01:19:56.167 --> 01:19:57.961
Marcus. I think
she cut my hair!

1188
01:19:58.044 --> 01:20:00.338
Marcus. what did she do?

1189
01:20:02.215 --> 01:20:03.383
[dings]

1190
01:20:05.969 --> 01:20:07.387
[choking. panting]

1191
01:20:11.808 --> 01:20:12.809
Marcus?

1192
01:20:16.771 --> 01:20:17.772
Marcus?

1193
01:20:28.116 --> 01:20:28.950
[gasps]

1194
01:20:36.457 --> 01:20:38.084
[gurgling]

1195
01:20:50.138 --> 01:20:51.389
- Well...
- [thudding]

1196
01:20:54.392 --> 01:20:55.518
[groaning]

1197
01:20:58.021 --> 01:20:59.689
- [Gladys humming]
- [thudding continues]

1198
01:21:10.742 --> 01:21:12.744
[Marcus groaning and panting]

1199
01:21:48.488 --> 01:21:49.489
[sighs]

1200
01:22:04.670 --> 01:22:06.631
- [Marcus panting]
- [dog barking]

1201
01:22:09.092 --> 01:22:10.134
[person on street] Look!

1202
01:22:10.218 --> 01:22:11.219
[car tires screech.
horn honks]

1203
01:22:12.470 --> 01:22:13.888
[person in park]
Yo. what the fuck. man?

1204
01:22:15.765 --> 01:22:17.016
[people in park shouting]

1205
01:22:17.767 --> 01:22:18.768
[person at table] Oh. my God.

1206
01:22:18.851 --> 01:22:20.603
[panting continuing]

1207
01:22:26.609 --> 01:22:28.402
[Archer]Come out with it.
Just think of the kids.

1208
01:22:28.486 --> 01:22:30.071
- Stop thinking of yourself!
- [Justine] Marcus?

1209
01:22:30.154 --> 01:22:31.989
- You and I are gonna have a...
- [Marcus snarling]

1210
01:22:32.073 --> 01:22:33.491
- [Justine shrieking]
- [Marcus grunting]

1211
01:22:37.495 --> 01:22:38.496
[Archer yells]

1212
01:22:45.586 --> 01:22:46.963
[snarling]

1213
01:22:49.715 --> 01:22:50.758
[Archer yells]

1214
01:22:52.051 --> 01:22:53.052
[Archer] Stay down.

1215
01:22:55.721 --> 01:22:57.140
Hey! Stop! No!

1216
01:22:58.558 --> 01:23:00.351
Oh. my God. [whimpering]

1217
01:23:00.434 --> 01:23:02.436
Help me. please. Please.

1218
01:23:02.520 --> 01:23:04.230
Oh. God. No! [screams]

1219
01:23:04.313 --> 01:23:05.815
- [whimpering]
- [door chimes]

1220
01:23:09.443 --> 01:23:10.444
[shrieking]

1221
01:23:11.571 --> 01:23:12.572
Oh. my God.

1222
01:23:12.655 --> 01:23:14.699
[screaming]

1223
01:23:18.452 --> 01:23:19.829
[shrieking]

1224
01:23:20.872 --> 01:23:21.998
[Archer] Hey!

1225
01:23:24.834 --> 01:23:25.835
Oh. my...

1226
01:23:25.918 --> 01:23:27.295
[gasping]

1227
01:23:30.006 --> 01:23:31.424
[whimpers. babbles]

1228
01:23:34.969 --> 01:23:37.221
- Get out of my store!
- Fucking help me!

1229
01:23:37.305 --> 01:23:39.056
[shrieking]

1230
01:23:44.103 --> 01:23:45.605
- [Marcus growling]
- [screaming]

1231
01:23:45.688 --> 01:23:47.773
[Marcus babbling]

1232
01:23:49.150 --> 01:23:50.693
[snarling]

1233
01:23:53.905 --> 01:23:55.198
[Justine screaming]

1234
01:24:01.954 --> 01:24:03.039
What the fuck?

1235
01:24:03.789 --> 01:24:05.166
[groaning]

1236
01:24:09.879 --> 01:24:10.880
Motherfucker.

1237
01:24:21.807 --> 01:24:23.809
Come on. you piece of shit.

1238
01:24:29.106 --> 01:24:31.442
[muffled screaming]

1239
01:24:37.156 --> 01:24:39.158
[screaming continuing]

1240
01:24:41.285 --> 01:24:42.578
[woman screaming]

1241
01:24:48.376 --> 01:24:49.585
[sound becomes clearer]

1242
01:24:49.669 --> 01:24:52.296
[woman continues screaming]

1243
01:24:54.257 --> 01:24:55.841
[low chattering]

1244
01:25:02.723 --> 01:25:04.433
[no audible dialogue]

1245
01:25:27.581 --> 01:25:28.582
Are you okay?

1246
01:25:29.709 --> 01:25:31.669
Yeah. I think so.

1247
01:25:32.461 --> 01:25:33.462
I'm just. uh...

1248
01:25:34.588 --> 01:25:35.589
scraped up.

1249
01:25:36.299 --> 01:25:37.300
You?

1250
01:25:39.343 --> 01:25:40.344
The same.

1251
01:25:41.846 --> 01:25:43.097
I-I wanna thank you.

1252
01:25:43.180 --> 01:25:45.016
- Ah...
- No. I do. So. thank you.

1253
01:25:47.435 --> 01:25:48.436
Sure.

1254
01:25:48.978 --> 01:25:50.438
I mean. what else could I do?

1255
01:25:53.190 --> 01:25:54.525
Guy was out of control.

1256
01:25:55.443 --> 01:25:58.654
The last time I talked to him.
he was fine.

1257
01:25:58.738 --> 01:26:00.197
I mean. he really was.

1258
01:26:00.698 --> 01:26:01.699
[stammers]

1259
01:26:02.325 --> 01:26:05.453
I've never seen anything
like that in my life.

1260
01:26:06.495 --> 01:26:07.496
I have.

1261
01:26:08.331 --> 01:26:09.665
What are you talking about?

1262
01:26:11.042 --> 01:26:13.502
The way he was running.
I've seen that before.

1263
01:26:17.548 --> 01:26:18.799
Can I show you something?

1264
01:26:20.134 --> 01:26:23.012
Their little girl ran
the same way Matthew did.

1265
01:26:23.095 --> 01:26:25.348
Same posture. same exact way.

1266
01:26:25.431 --> 01:26:28.184
Just like Marcus
ran after you today.

1267
01:26:28.267 --> 01:26:29.643
He was weaponized.

1268
01:26:29.727 --> 01:26:32.897
Like a heat-seeking missile
just locked onto you.

1269
01:26:33.689 --> 01:26:36.317
So. here. Look at this.
This is my house.

1270
01:26:36.400 --> 01:26:37.985
This is Bailey Kramer's house.

1271
01:26:38.069 --> 01:26:40.196
Now. if you assume they were
heading in a straight line

1272
01:26:40.279 --> 01:26:42.281
at just some target of theirs.

1273
01:26:42.365 --> 01:26:44.658
and you assume they both had
the same target.

1274
01:26:44.742 --> 01:26:47.328
those lines intersect
somewhere around here.

1275
01:26:47.411 --> 01:26:48.245
Oh. my God.

1276
01:26:48.329 --> 01:26:49.705
There must be something
about this area.

1277
01:26:49.789 --> 01:26:51.999
- Alex.
- Some-- What?

1278
01:26:52.708 --> 01:26:55.086
Alex Lilly lives
in this house.

1279
01:27:01.050 --> 01:27:04.220
[teacher] Who else can think
of an example of a parasite?

1280
01:27:04.762 --> 01:27:05.763
Anyone?

1281
01:27:06.722 --> 01:27:08.474
- Lisa?
- A tapeworm.

1282
01:27:08.557 --> 01:27:10.768
A tapeworm! Very good!

1283
01:27:10.851 --> 01:27:12.436
That's a gross one. right?

1284
01:27:12.520 --> 01:27:16.065
It lives in your intestines
and it eats your food.

1285
01:27:16.148 --> 01:27:17.483
[children chattering]

1286
01:27:20.653 --> 01:27:21.862
Stop it.

1287
01:27:21.946 --> 01:27:22.947
"Stop it."

1288
01:27:24.365 --> 01:27:26.659
- "Stop it."
- [other children laughing]

1289
01:27:26.742 --> 01:27:27.785
"Stop it."

1290
01:27:29.036 --> 01:27:30.079
"Stop it."

1291
01:27:38.254 --> 01:27:40.172
[children chatter. shout]

1292
01:27:46.554 --> 01:27:47.721
[man] What's up. Axe Man?

1293
01:27:50.683 --> 01:27:53.018
Talk to me. Axe Man.
How was school today?

1294
01:27:53.936 --> 01:27:56.439
- Good.
- Good? Kiss any supermodels?

1295
01:27:56.522 --> 01:27:57.982
[chuckles] No.

1296
01:27:58.065 --> 01:27:59.733
No? All right.

1297
01:28:01.444 --> 01:28:03.487
Well.
tonight's the night. pal.

1298
01:28:04.071 --> 01:28:06.532
Your mom's aunt Gladys
is coming. remember?

1299
01:28:07.491 --> 01:28:10.494
[sighs] Why do we have to
have her live at our house?

1300
01:28:11.120 --> 01:28:13.122
'Cause it's like
we talked about.

1301
01:28:13.706 --> 01:28:17.668
She's sick. and she doesn't
have anywhere else to go.

1302
01:28:19.420 --> 01:28:21.422
But I don't even
know her. though.

1303
01:28:21.505 --> 01:28:24.091
Pfft. I hear you. bud.
I don't know her either.

1304
01:28:24.800 --> 01:28:27.678
To be honest. I'm not sure
your mom knows her that well.

1305
01:28:27.761 --> 01:28:31.140
But she's family.
Family's important.

1306
01:28:32.057 --> 01:28:33.601
We gotta help each other out.

1307
01:28:34.310 --> 01:28:35.895
Hey. found a kid.

1308
01:28:36.395 --> 01:28:39.523
Hey. My men have returned.

1309
01:28:39.607 --> 01:28:40.608
- Hi.
- Hi.

1310
01:28:40.691 --> 01:28:42.776
Whoa. Hey. Good day at school?

1311
01:28:42.860 --> 01:28:44.445
- Yeah.
- Okay. good.

1312
01:28:44.528 --> 01:28:47.114
Uh. I would really like to
get this house cleaned up

1313
01:28:47.198 --> 01:28:48.741
before your aunt Gladys
gets here.

1314
01:28:48.824 --> 01:28:50.493
So do me a favor.
get your room cleaned up

1315
01:28:50.576 --> 01:28:52.119
before you start
your homework.

1316
01:28:52.203 --> 01:28:54.163
She's not coming in my room.
is she?

1317
01:28:54.914 --> 01:28:56.165
I'd really like a clean house.

1318
01:28:56.248 --> 01:28:58.459
That includes your room.
so let's go.

1319
01:28:59.418 --> 01:29:02.671
I know. It's horrible
cleaning up after yourself.

1320
01:29:12.973 --> 01:29:14.934
[car doors shutting]

1321
01:29:30.324 --> 01:29:31.534
[dad] All right?

1322
01:29:38.207 --> 01:29:40.125
[mom] Hi! Come in!

1323
01:29:40.209 --> 01:29:42.169
- [dad] Got the door?
- [mom] I got it.

1324
01:29:42.253 --> 01:29:44.088
[dad] One more step.

1325
01:29:55.766 --> 01:29:58.435
[dad] I'm just saying
she looked really bad.

1326
01:29:58.519 --> 01:29:59.770
I don't know if this
is the place for...

1327
01:29:59.853 --> 01:30:02.147
Yeah. well. it's either here
or out on the street. Stephen.

1328
01:30:02.231 --> 01:30:05.734
Well. you know. this ain't
a hospice place. hon.

1329
01:30:05.818 --> 01:30:06.860
I know that. I know.

1330
01:30:06.944 --> 01:30:08.821
We're not equipped for this
kind of thing. All right?

1331
01:30:08.904 --> 01:30:11.115
We hadn't seen this woman
in 15 years.

1332
01:30:11.198 --> 01:30:12.616
She didn't even show up
to our wedding...

1333
01:30:12.700 --> 01:30:13.993
Look. my mom
would do this for her.

1334
01:30:14.076 --> 01:30:16.370
so I'm gonna do this
for her. okay?

1335
01:30:16.453 --> 01:30:17.705
I could really
use your support.

1336
01:30:17.788 --> 01:30:18.998
If at any point
you feel like...

1337
01:30:19.540 --> 01:30:21.584
Alex. honey.
what are you doing?

1338
01:30:21.667 --> 01:30:22.710
I'm hungry.

1339
01:30:22.793 --> 01:30:24.378
Oh. you're hungry.
Okay. All right.

1340
01:30:24.461 --> 01:30:25.629
Well. go downstairs. eat up

1341
01:30:25.713 --> 01:30:28.340
and then go brush your teeth.
okay? It's almost 7:30.

1342
01:30:28.424 --> 01:30:31.051
And be quiet back there.
Your aunt Gladys is sleeping.

1343
01:30:56.660 --> 01:30:57.661
[door creaks]

1344
01:31:08.547 --> 01:31:10.007
[door creaking]

1345
01:31:21.310 --> 01:31:22.144
[gasps]

1346
01:31:24.480 --> 01:31:26.607
How long
is she gonna stay with us?

1347
01:31:29.068 --> 01:31:30.527
Hard to say. pal.

1348
01:31:31.612 --> 01:31:33.781
Doesn't look like
she's getting much better.

1349
01:31:35.074 --> 01:31:37.284
So she's gonna stay
with us forever?

1350
01:31:37.368 --> 01:31:38.619
No.

1351
01:31:38.702 --> 01:31:39.745
I...

1352
01:31:39.828 --> 01:31:41.955
I don't think she'll be here
longer than a month.

1353
01:31:47.878 --> 01:31:49.338
[children chattering]

1354
01:31:55.928 --> 01:31:57.846
- All righty. man.
- All righty.

1355
01:31:57.930 --> 01:31:59.098
I'll pick you up
at 2:00. okay?

1356
01:31:59.181 --> 01:32:00.849
- See ya.
- See ya.

1357
01:32:00.933 --> 01:32:02.601
- I love you.
- Love ya.

1358
01:32:06.563 --> 01:32:08.524
[Justine] That's time.
Pencils down.

1359
01:32:09.858 --> 01:32:11.110
Matthew!

1360
01:32:11.193 --> 01:32:12.444
What?
You said. "Pencils down."

1361
01:32:12.528 --> 01:32:14.154
Matthew. outside now.

1362
01:32:14.238 --> 01:32:15.447
Alex. are you okay?

1363
01:32:15.531 --> 01:32:16.907
I'm fine.

1364
01:32:16.990 --> 01:32:19.201
Matthew. let's go.
Get your bag.

1365
01:32:19.952 --> 01:32:22.204
It was a joke. Oh. my God!

1366
01:32:23.330 --> 01:32:24.957
- [bell ringing]
- [students chattering]

1367
01:32:43.600 --> 01:32:45.728
- You miss your ride. son?
- I'm okay.

1368
01:32:45.811 --> 01:32:46.812
You sure?

1369
01:33:36.028 --> 01:33:40.741
Mom. Dad. where were you?

1370
01:33:41.825 --> 01:33:44.912
Hey. Axe Man. How was school?

1371
01:33:46.246 --> 01:33:47.247
What's wrong?

1372
01:33:47.998 --> 01:33:49.166
Alex?

1373
01:33:49.958 --> 01:33:52.085
Oh. welcome home.

1374
01:33:52.169 --> 01:33:53.045
[chuckles]

1375
01:33:53.128 --> 01:33:54.671
How are you. sweetie?

1376
01:33:57.174 --> 01:33:58.592
Let me take a look at you.

1377
01:33:58.675 --> 01:33:59.676
Oh. you know.
I haven't seen you

1378
01:33:59.760 --> 01:34:01.804
since you were
a little teeny baby.

1379
01:34:01.887 --> 01:34:03.222
What's wrong with my parents?

1380
01:34:03.305 --> 01:34:05.849
Oh. nothing. sweetheart.
They're just fine.

1381
01:34:05.933 --> 01:34:07.184
Mom.

1382
01:34:09.019 --> 01:34:11.980
Hey. How was school?

1383
01:34:12.064 --> 01:34:14.858
You see? I told you.
she's just fine. Don't worry.

1384
01:34:17.110 --> 01:34:18.111
Alex.

1385
01:34:19.196 --> 01:34:20.489
Now. don't be rude.

1386
01:34:21.740 --> 01:34:23.158
Why don't you sit down
at the table?

1387
01:34:23.242 --> 01:34:24.827
'Cause I'm making dinner.
I should have asked you.

1388
01:34:24.910 --> 01:34:25.994
but you weren't here.

1389
01:34:26.078 --> 01:34:27.788
so I thought mac and cheese
would...

1390
01:34:28.580 --> 01:34:29.748
Dad!

1391
01:34:29.832 --> 01:34:32.000
Alex. that's it.

1392
01:34:32.084 --> 01:34:34.253
I want you to go upstairs.
wash your face.

1393
01:34:34.336 --> 01:34:35.921
brush your teeth.
and then it is bedtime.

1394
01:34:36.004 --> 01:34:37.047
No dinner for you.

1395
01:34:40.425 --> 01:34:41.969
I'm not kidding. young man.
Go.

1396
01:35:19.172 --> 01:35:20.674
Come. Sit.

1397
01:35:30.851 --> 01:35:31.852
Alex.

1398
01:35:32.519 --> 01:35:33.562
Sit.

1399
01:35:39.359 --> 01:35:41.028
Don't worry about
your parents.

1400
01:35:41.111 --> 01:35:42.404
They're just resting.

1401
01:35:46.658 --> 01:35:49.995
Now. before you go to school
today. I want you to promise

1402
01:35:50.078 --> 01:35:53.206
that you will not tell
a living soul that I am here

1403
01:35:54.207 --> 01:35:56.543
or that your parents
are resting like they are.

1404
01:36:00.172 --> 01:36:01.423
Do you hear me. Alex?

1405
01:36:08.347 --> 01:36:09.348
Watch.

1406
01:36:12.142 --> 01:36:13.226
Ooh.

1407
01:36:23.528 --> 01:36:24.905
Are you watching?

1408
01:36:36.249 --> 01:36:37.542
Stop!

1409
01:36:38.627 --> 01:36:39.795
Stop. Dad!

1410
01:36:42.255 --> 01:36:43.423
Alex.

1411
01:36:52.599 --> 01:36:53.642
Sit down.

1412
01:37:05.278 --> 01:37:07.489
Now. when I tell you
that you are not to speak

1413
01:37:07.572 --> 01:37:10.450
about me or your parents
to anyone...

1414
01:37:12.077 --> 01:37:15.372
you understand what can happen
if you break your promise.

1415
01:37:18.709 --> 01:37:20.460
I can make your parents
hurt themselves.

1416
01:37:20.544 --> 01:37:22.462
I can make them
hurt each other.

1417
01:37:25.716 --> 01:37:28.510
I can make them eat each other
if I want to.

1418
01:37:32.347 --> 01:37:34.016
Do I want to. Alex?

1419
01:37:36.643 --> 01:37:38.061
Do you believe me?

1420
01:37:42.232 --> 01:37:43.567
Promise you will not
talk about me

1421
01:37:43.650 --> 01:37:45.986
to another human being.
Say it.

1422
01:37:47.446 --> 01:37:48.572
I promise.

1423
01:37:50.323 --> 01:37:51.700
'Cause I'll know. Alex.

1424
01:37:54.911 --> 01:37:56.663
Go to school. Take the bus.

1425
01:38:56.348 --> 01:38:57.724
No talking today.

1426
01:38:59.392 --> 01:39:00.393
Good boy.

1427
01:39:01.853 --> 01:39:03.146
You'll need to
feed your parents.

1428
01:39:03.230 --> 01:39:04.648
There's soup in the cabinet.

1429
01:39:06.817 --> 01:39:08.485
Tomorrow.
you'll get some more.

1430
01:39:29.047 --> 01:39:30.590
[students shouting.
chattering]

1431
01:39:53.822 --> 01:39:54.990
[Gladys. distant] Alex.

1432
01:39:59.619 --> 01:40:00.620
Alex?

1433
01:40:11.423 --> 01:40:12.424
[Gladys coughs]

1434
01:40:23.643 --> 01:40:24.936
Come here. sweetie.

1435
01:40:26.021 --> 01:40:27.689
[labored breathing]

1436
01:40:31.568 --> 01:40:32.611
Oh.

1437
01:40:36.323 --> 01:40:38.033
I'm very sick. Alex.

1438
01:40:40.368 --> 01:40:42.120
Would you like some water?

1439
01:40:42.954 --> 01:40:44.539
Well. water won't help me.

1440
01:40:45.665 --> 01:40:47.375
I'm too sick for water.

1441
01:40:48.585 --> 01:40:50.754
I have been
for a very long time.

1442
01:40:52.464 --> 01:40:53.924
What will make you better?

1443
01:40:56.718 --> 01:40:58.345
Well. I was hoping
your mom and dad

1444
01:40:58.428 --> 01:40:59.638
would make me feel better.

1445
01:40:59.721 --> 01:41:02.390
but it doesn't seem to be
turning out so good.

1446
01:41:03.099 --> 01:41:05.185
Would you like to go
to a hospital?

1447
01:41:05.977 --> 01:41:08.063
Hospital won't fix me.

1448
01:41:13.652 --> 01:41:15.111
But maybe you could. though.

1449
01:41:15.195 --> 01:41:16.488
You could help.

1450
01:41:17.364 --> 01:41:18.365
How?

1451
01:41:19.241 --> 01:41:20.408
Well. at school.

1452
01:41:21.576 --> 01:41:25.080
bring an object from each
of your classmates home to me.

1453
01:41:26.164 --> 01:41:27.332
That might work.

1454
01:41:28.708 --> 01:41:30.293
How will that make you better?

1455
01:41:34.005 --> 01:41:36.132
It might be just what I need.

1456
01:41:39.302 --> 01:41:41.805
And if you got better.
you'd go back home?

1457
01:41:45.767 --> 01:41:47.269
If I got better...

1458
01:41:49.604 --> 01:41:51.022
I'd go back home.

1459
01:41:54.276 --> 01:41:55.360
[laughs]

1460
01:42:52.000 --> 01:42:53.001
Alex.

1461
01:42:54.961 --> 01:42:56.504
What are you doing in here?

1462
01:42:56.588 --> 01:42:59.132
Um. I didn't
feel like playing.

1463
01:42:59.215 --> 01:43:01.217
and I forgot something.

1464
01:43:02.635 --> 01:43:04.596
Whoa. whoa. whoa.
Hey. hey. hey.

1465
01:43:08.058 --> 01:43:09.059
Are you okay?

1466
01:43:09.684 --> 01:43:11.144
- Yeah.
- Yeah?

1467
01:43:12.103 --> 01:43:14.773
You've been
awful quiet lately.

1468
01:43:15.440 --> 01:43:16.608
Quieter than usual.

1469
01:43:17.275 --> 01:43:18.318
How are you doing?

1470
01:43:18.860 --> 01:43:21.321
I'm okay.
I just forgot something.

1471
01:43:22.238 --> 01:43:23.239
It's okay.

1472
01:43:25.367 --> 01:43:26.826
Alex. you know.

1473
01:43:26.910 --> 01:43:29.537
if... you ever want to talk
to someone.

1474
01:43:30.038 --> 01:43:31.456
you can always talk to me.

1475
01:43:33.041 --> 01:43:34.250
Do you know that?

1476
01:43:34.334 --> 01:43:35.418
Yeah.

1477
01:43:35.502 --> 01:43:37.754
You can talk to me
about anything you want.

1478
01:43:41.257 --> 01:43:42.634
I wanna go back now.

1479
01:43:44.552 --> 01:43:46.513
Okay. Go play.

1480
01:44:22.006 --> 01:44:23.133
[clanking]

1481
01:44:24.676 --> 01:44:26.344
[scraping. muffled speech]

1482
01:44:27.595 --> 01:44:29.222
[noise continuing]

1483
01:44:43.820 --> 01:44:45.071
What are you doing?

1484
01:45:07.886 --> 01:45:09.053
[rings]

1485
01:46:31.886 --> 01:46:33.137
[Justine laughing]

1486
01:46:33.221 --> 01:46:34.222
No...

1487
01:46:44.023 --> 01:46:46.276
[Gladys] <i>Stephen here suffered
a stroke a little while back.</i>

1488
01:46:46.359 --> 01:46:48.152
<i>so he's unable to speak.</i>

1489
01:46:48.236 --> 01:46:50.822
<i>And I'm taking care of
the family for the time being.</i>

1490
01:46:51.322 --> 01:46:53.032
I'm glad you both are here.

1491
01:46:53.116 --> 01:46:55.243
Alex. how are you doing. pal?

1492
01:46:55.326 --> 01:46:56.578
I'm okay.

1493
01:46:56.661 --> 01:46:58.204
[detective 1]Now. we're gonna
ask you some questions

1494
01:46:58.288 --> 01:47:00.123
about what happened
at school. okay?

1495
01:47:02.458 --> 01:47:04.294
Tomorrow.
people will come here.

1496
01:47:05.920 --> 01:47:07.839
And they will search
this house...

1497
01:47:12.510 --> 01:47:14.304
and we have to be ready.

1498
01:47:31.988 --> 01:47:33.656
[doorbell rings]

1499
01:47:33.740 --> 01:47:35.199
Detective. come in!

1500
01:47:35.283 --> 01:47:36.284
Good morning. Ms. Lilly.

1501
01:47:36.367 --> 01:47:37.535
- How are you today?
- Fine.

1502
01:47:37.619 --> 01:47:39.370
- Good to see you again.
- Nice to see you too.

1503
01:47:39.454 --> 01:47:41.080
- Remember Detective Colbert?
- Oh. yes.

1504
01:47:41.164 --> 01:47:43.541
We just wanted to come by the
house for a few minutes today

1505
01:47:43.625 --> 01:47:44.834
and look around. uh.

1506
01:47:44.917 --> 01:47:47.795
see the environment
that Alex has been living in.

1507
01:47:47.879 --> 01:47:51.341
And just get an idea of what
the family dynamic is like.

1508
01:47:51.424 --> 01:47:53.593
- Okay!
- Oh. Thank you.

1509
01:47:53.676 --> 01:47:54.677
And... Oh.

1510
01:47:54.761 --> 01:47:56.596
Hey. Alex.
How are you doing today?

1511
01:47:57.639 --> 01:47:58.890
He's a little quiet today.
right?

1512
01:47:58.973 --> 01:48:00.683
- Mm-hmm. Yes. he is.
